 was a tragedy  created by the evil nobles they knew  ryzel always acted rationally as he held  the role of nob lease and would  definitely stop the destruction of  humans and nobles he preferred peace  over war but he had no choice left now  muzaka attacked ryzel with his powerful  claws forcing ryzel to use blood  techniques when ryzel strangled him with  blood technique muzaka told him another  tragic truth about the real identity of  ashley the cute young girl was his  daughter and her mother was musaka's  love of life rizer was shocked to hear  about this and blood tears began to flow  through his eyes as he couldn't do  anything for his only friend and now he  had to take the life of muzaka to free  him from his overwhelming rage  ryzel ended up using his ultimate  technique bloodfield and awakening to  free musaka from rage the technique  drained a lot of energy and vitality  from ryzel forcing him to enter a deep  sleep in his coffin the entire area got  destroyed by ryzel's power leaving  nothing behind the coffin of ryzel  settled in the depths of the ocean but  this wasn't the end for him you should  never try to end the movie without  checking for the post-credits scenes so  in the post-credits scene a diving man  found ryzel's coffin in the deep ocean  and was shocked to see it this was the  main plot of what happened in the first  ova now let's talk about the second ova  nobley's awakening this episode features  the 21st century of the human world  where everything has become advanced  because of high-end technology and  progress in science however evil people  and organizations still operate behind  calm and prosperous cities an evil  organization has made several agents  with supernatural abilities by  conducting forbidden and immoral  experiments the organization has been  looking for the nobles rizelle to  harness his powers for their own benefit  and surprise surprise a government  organization has discovered the coffin  of ryzel while exploring t